<ontology/use_hats_brushes_upholstery/use_hats_brushes_upholstery__0096__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Products of the Vegetable Kingdom (1854; Project Gutenberg #15191), section LOGWOOD" ;
